WEBVTT

00:03.712 --> 00:05.171
Draw your swords.

00:06.339 --> 00:08.299
If it shows itself,

00:09.175 --> 00:10.301
we'll only have a moment.

00:17.225 --> 00:18.143
Move!

00:32.365 --> 00:33.199
It's fast!

00:33.283 --> 00:36.119
There's no way to avoid it
inside this forest!

00:36.202 --> 00:37.370
It's catching up!

00:37.537 --> 00:39.622
Captain! Let's switch
to omnidirectional mobility!

00:40.123 --> 00:41.166
Captain!

00:43.293 --> 00:44.711
You're not going anywhere!

00:45.336 --> 00:46.629
Reinforcements from the rear!

01:02.645 --> 01:04.481
Captain! Give your orders!

01:04.689 --> 01:07.108
Let's take it out! It's dangerous!

01:07.358 --> 01:08.902
We should take care of it!

01:08.985 --> 01:11.988
- It's about to catch up to us!
- Let's take it out here!

01:12.072 --> 01:16.076
That's why we entered this forest!
Isn't it, Captain?

01:16.159 --> 01:17.869
Captain! Your orders!

01:21.164 --> 01:23.333
Everyone, cover your ears.

03:25.246 --> 03:26.331
An acoustic shell?

03:27.498 --> 03:29.042
Tell me. What is your job again?

03:29.459 --> 03:32.253
Is it simply to surrender
to your fleeting emotions?

03:32.879 --> 03:34.547
No, it's not.

03:35.048 --> 03:36.341
This squad's mission

03:36.883 --> 03:40.345
is to do everything possible
to keep this brat unharmed.

03:41.512 --> 03:42.847
Down to our last breath.

03:46.893 --> 03:48.770
It's not to keep an eye on me?

03:49.312 --> 03:51.731
We're going to keep pushing ahead
on horseback.

03:52.065 --> 03:52.941
Got it?

03:53.024 --> 03:53.900
Understood, sir!

03:55.318 --> 03:56.569
Push ahead?

03:56.861 --> 03:58.196
But for how long?

03:58.529 --> 04:01.324
Not to mention,
it's almost on top of us now!

04:02.825 --> 04:03.785
More...

04:04.827 --> 04:05.828
More reinforcements!

04:05.912 --> 04:08.539
They'll get killed too
if we don't hurry and help them!

04:08.623 --> 04:10.166
Eren! Face forward!

04:10.541 --> 04:11.584
Gunther?

04:12.001 --> 04:13.169
Don't fall out of step!

04:13.419 --> 04:14.921
Maintain top speed!

04:15.004 --> 04:16.089
Eld?

04:16.673 --> 04:17.715
Why?

04:17.882 --> 04:21.511
Who could possibly stop it,
if not Squad Levi?

04:25.640 --> 04:27.016
Another one is dead!

04:27.809 --> 04:29.936
We could have saved him too!

04:33.773 --> 04:37.026
One person is still fighting!
There's still time to save him!

04:37.110 --> 04:39.279
Eren! Focus ahead and keep moving!

04:39.612 --> 04:42.156
Are you telling me
to ignore the fighting behind us?

04:42.240 --> 04:45.159
To just run away and abandon my comrades?

04:45.243 --> 04:46.411
Yes, I am!

04:46.703 --> 04:48.413
Do as the Captain says!

04:48.788 --> 04:51.040
I don't understand
why we're letting them die!

04:51.124 --> 04:53.543
And I don't understand
why he won't explain!

04:53.626 --> 04:54.585
Why?

04:54.877 --> 04:57.922
Because the Captain doesn't feel
the need to explain!

04:58.006 --> 05:01.092
But you don't understand that
because you're still inexperienced!

05:02.010 --> 05:03.636
Now shut up and follow orders!

05:08.766 --> 05:09.600
No.

05:12.145 --> 05:14.564
I can fight on my own, actually.

05:18.234 --> 05:20.987
Why should I always have
to rely on others?

05:21.612 --> 05:23.614
I can just fight on my own!

05:27.702 --> 05:29.162
What are you doing, Eren?

05:30.413 --> 05:34.000
You're only permitted to do that
when your life is in danger.

05:34.083 --> 05:36.002
That was our agreement, remember?

05:39.338 --> 05:40.173
Eren!

05:41.299 --> 05:43.092
You're not in the wrong.

05:45.595 --> 05:46.971
If you want to do it, do it.

05:50.016 --> 05:51.350
I can tell.

05:51.893 --> 05:56.981
He's a real monster,
and not because of his Titan ability.

05:58.316 --> 06:00.443
No matter how hard he's restrained,

06:00.818 --> 06:02.820
no matter what cage he's put inside,

06:03.362 --> 06:07.241
no one can ever tame him.

06:08.326 --> 06:10.953
I want to slaughter every Titan I can!

06:11.913 --> 06:12.872
Eren.

06:13.289 --> 06:17.502
Our difference in experience
is why we don't see eye-to-eye.

06:18.294 --> 06:21.506
But you don't need to mind that.

06:22.548 --> 06:23.549
Choose.

06:24.550 --> 06:26.052
Will you trust yourself,

06:26.928 --> 06:30.223
or me, these guys,
and the entire Scout Regiment?

06:32.850 --> 06:34.393
I don't know the answer to that.

06:34.769 --> 06:35.895
I never have.

06:36.646 --> 06:38.356
Whether I trusted myself

06:38.856 --> 06:41.526
or the choices of my dependable comrades,

06:42.235 --> 06:44.654
there was no telling
how things would turn out.

06:45.363 --> 06:48.032
So just do the best you can

06:48.616 --> 06:51.285
and choose
whichever you'll regret the least.

07:09.178 --> 07:10.012
Eren!

07:12.432 --> 07:13.433
Trust us.

07:21.065 --> 07:24.068
I've come up with a way to stop you
without completely killing you.

07:25.361 --> 07:26.320
Sir?

07:27.989 --> 07:32.160
Before, I said the only way
to stop you in Titan form is to kill you.

07:33.369 --> 07:35.913
But this method
will only leave you mutilated.

07:36.247 --> 07:39.125
It depends entirely
on individual skill though.

07:40.084 --> 07:44.297
Basically, it involves cutting the nape,
with you in it, off of the body.

07:45.089 --> 07:48.593
The ends of your limbs
will get severed in the process,

07:49.260 --> 07:50.344
but I assume

07:50.428 --> 07:52.013
they'll just grow back anyway,
like a lizard.

07:52.305 --> 07:53.473
It creeps me out.

07:54.223 --> 07:55.266
Wait.

07:56.225 --> 07:58.644
I'm not sure how to make them grow back.

07:58.978 --> 08:00.688
Isn't there some other way?

08:02.815 --> 08:07.361
So you want to do it without taking
any risks or making any sacrifices?

08:08.029 --> 08:08.905
No.

08:09.280 --> 08:10.740
Then prepare for the worst.

08:11.157 --> 08:15.036
We're in the same boat. You could kill us.

08:15.620 --> 08:17.121
So just relax.

08:17.788 --> 08:18.873
Yes, sir.

08:19.415 --> 08:20.374
I understand.

08:20.458 --> 08:23.544
So I can start experimenting, right?

08:24.003 --> 08:25.588
It's risky,

08:25.922 --> 08:29.842
but we can't risk not testing him either.

08:30.384 --> 08:32.762
I'll take charge of the planning then.

08:34.013 --> 08:35.014
Eren.

08:35.348 --> 08:38.184
If you're unsure about anything,
then just learn as you go.

08:38.976 --> 08:42.897
Anything we learn
is easily worth risking our lives for.

08:46.526 --> 08:48.569
You ready down there, Eren?

08:50.154 --> 08:53.115
I'll fire a smoke signal
when we're ready to begin.

08:53.741 --> 08:56.202
Everything after that is up to you!

08:56.786 --> 08:57.954
Understood!

08:58.454 --> 08:59.330
Yes.

08:59.413 --> 09:04.502
Even if he becomes a mindless Titan,
this dry well will hold him!

09:04.835 --> 09:05.670
I think!

09:08.506 --> 09:09.507
There's the signal.

09:11.092 --> 09:14.637
I haven't used my Titan form
since I sealed the hole in the wall.

09:15.805 --> 09:17.557
If I go out of control this time,

09:18.099 --> 09:21.769
Squad Levi might end up killing me.

09:31.195 --> 09:33.364
Did he not see the signal or something?

09:33.906 --> 09:34.949
No.

09:35.783 --> 09:38.995
I doubt this would work so easily.

09:41.747 --> 09:43.207
Hey! Eren!

09:43.457 --> 09:44.709
The test is off for now!

09:47.086 --> 09:48.588
Did something happen?

09:53.593 --> 09:54.885
Hange.

09:56.596 --> 09:58.347
I can't turn into a Titan.

10:04.937 --> 10:07.940
Not even the bite wounds
on your hands have gone away?

10:10.318 --> 10:11.235
No, sir.

10:12.028 --> 10:14.405
If you can't turn into a Titan,

10:14.739 --> 10:18.034
our big plans for sealing Wall Maria
go up in smoke.

10:19.702 --> 10:20.911
Figure it out.

10:21.287 --> 10:22.747
That's an order.

10:24.540 --> 10:25.416
Yes, sir.

10:27.335 --> 10:29.503
Don't lose heart, Eren.

10:30.421 --> 10:31.464
But...

10:31.714 --> 10:35.760
This just means you're more human
than we thought.

10:37.553 --> 10:40.723
It's a lot better than ending up dead
because you were too hasty.

10:41.265 --> 10:42.767
It wasn't a waste of time.

10:43.017 --> 10:43.893
Yes.

10:44.143 --> 10:46.687
There's no such thing
as being too careful.

10:49.273 --> 10:52.360
Why are they all so calm?

10:53.819 --> 10:56.405
Is it actually okay
that I can't turn into a Titan?

11:06.457 --> 11:07.375
Are you okay?

11:07.541 --> 11:08.376
Yes.

11:22.014 --> 11:22.848
Hey!

11:22.932 --> 11:23.766
What the...

11:24.767 --> 11:26.102
What was that explosion?

11:37.822 --> 11:39.448
Why now?

11:39.532 --> 11:40.408
Calm down.

11:40.866 --> 11:42.034
Captain Levi!

11:42.618 --> 11:43.702
I don't know what...

11:45.663 --> 11:47.289
I said calm down,

11:47.748 --> 11:48.749
all of you.

12:06.100 --> 12:06.934
What?

12:07.017 --> 12:07.893
What was that sound?

12:22.450 --> 12:23.284
Eren!

12:23.826 --> 12:24.994
What is the meaning of this?

12:25.995 --> 12:26.871
Sir?

12:27.079 --> 12:28.956
Why did you do it without permission?

12:29.039 --> 12:29.874
Answer me!

12:29.957 --> 12:31.917
- Wait, Eld.
- Answer him, Eren!

12:32.001 --> 12:33.002
Explain yourself!

12:34.128 --> 12:36.297
No! That can come later!

12:36.881 --> 12:41.177
First, you need to prove you aren't
hostile toward us, no, toward humanity!

12:41.385 --> 12:42.344
What?

12:42.428 --> 12:44.096
Prove it! Now!

12:44.180 --> 12:45.931
You bear that responsibility!

12:46.015 --> 12:48.350
If you so much as twitch
that arm of yours,

12:48.559 --> 12:50.519
your head is coming right off!

12:50.978 --> 12:53.814
I'll do it too!
I really will! Just try me!

12:53.898 --> 12:54.773
Oruo!

12:54.857 --> 12:55.858
I told you to calm down!

12:55.941 --> 12:58.277
Captain! Please get away from Eren!

12:58.360 --> 13:01.697
- You're too close!
- No, you're the ones who need to get away.

13:01.947 --> 13:03.324
- Step back.
- Why, sir?

13:03.407 --> 13:05.242
- A gut feeling.
- What's the deal, Eren?

13:05.326 --> 13:06.494
Say something!

13:06.577 --> 13:08.162
- Seriously, I--
- Don't try anything funny!

13:08.245 --> 13:09.246
Prove to us!

13:09.330 --> 13:10.498
- Eren!
- Seriously, I don't--

13:10.581 --> 13:13.459
- Answer the question!
- You think we can't kill you?

13:13.542 --> 13:15.294
- I'm serious here!
- Answer this instant!

13:15.377 --> 13:16.921
- Did you not hear me?
- Okay! Let's do it!

13:17.004 --> 13:20.758
- You're a threat to humanity!
- Will you guys please be quiet?

13:27.014 --> 13:29.183
Eren!

13:29.642 --> 13:32.811
Can I touch that arm?

13:33.229 --> 13:34.688
Please? Can I?

13:34.772 --> 13:35.773
Pretty please?

13:35.856 --> 13:38.234
- I just want to touch it!
- Hange!

13:38.400 --> 13:39.568
Wait, don't--

13:41.695 --> 13:42.571
That hurts!

13:42.988 --> 13:44.114
It's hot!

13:44.532 --> 13:47.243
Damn, it's hot when there's no skin!

13:47.326 --> 13:49.995
- It's so damn hot!
- Section Commander!

13:50.454 --> 13:51.956
You live like a maniac!

13:52.540 --> 13:55.084
Say, is it not hot for you, Eren?

13:55.292 --> 13:58.128
How is it connected to your right hand?

13:58.212 --> 13:59.797
I really want to see!

14:00.089 --> 14:00.923
Oh, right!

14:01.215 --> 14:03.968
If I just pull my hand out...

14:04.718 --> 14:05.761
Come on!

14:09.223 --> 14:10.349
Hey, Eren!

14:10.432 --> 14:11.684
Don't try anything funny!

14:16.397 --> 14:17.523
What?

14:17.606 --> 14:20.025
Hold on, Eren! That was too soon!

14:20.109 --> 14:22.278
I still wanted to study it!

14:34.331 --> 14:35.457
Captain.

14:36.959 --> 14:38.460
How are you feeling?

14:44.550 --> 14:48.804
Not very good.

14:55.811 --> 14:58.147
Until they actually turned hostile,

14:58.814 --> 15:04.028
I never realized
how little they trusted me.

15:04.778 --> 15:06.071
Of course, they don't.

15:06.530 --> 15:08.782
That's why I picked them.

15:10.492 --> 15:13.287
The common belief is that
the first time you come back alive

15:13.412 --> 15:15.623
makes you a bonafide Scout.

15:16.415 --> 15:19.376
But up against Titans,
there's never enough information.

15:20.419 --> 15:24.089
There are always too many unknowns
and uncertainties.

15:25.674 --> 15:28.218
In which case,
you need to be able to act quickly

15:28.636 --> 15:31.305
and make tough decisions
based on the worst-case scenario.

15:32.389 --> 15:35.976
But that doesn't mean
they're cold and heartless.

15:36.727 --> 15:40.940
Pointing their blades at you like that,
they must have felt bad.

15:42.232 --> 15:43.943
- Captain Levi.
- Yes?

15:44.777 --> 15:46.362
Section Commander Hange wishes to see you.

15:49.865 --> 15:51.700
Were you taking a long crap?

15:51.784 --> 15:53.285
No.

15:53.619 --> 15:54.787
A pleasant one.

15:55.412 --> 15:57.831
I got stuck explaining things
to the top brass.

15:58.874 --> 16:00.042
But anyway,

16:00.960 --> 16:02.002
take a look at this.

16:03.671 --> 16:05.673
A teaspoon?

16:06.131 --> 16:07.049
Yes.

16:07.758 --> 16:10.970
That right Titan hand
you created was holding this.

16:11.387 --> 16:14.807
Between the index finger
and thumb, like this.

16:15.391 --> 16:16.225
What?

16:16.517 --> 16:19.770
It's hard to imagine
that it was through sheer dumb luck.

16:20.437 --> 16:24.274
And somehow, it hasn't been warped
by the heat or pressure.

16:25.025 --> 16:26.402
Any thoughts on this?

16:28.278 --> 16:30.280
As I recall, I was trying to pick it up.

16:30.656 --> 16:32.992
I transformed right after that.

16:34.201 --> 16:35.369
I see.

16:36.412 --> 16:40.207
This might explain why you couldn't turn
into a Titan earlier.

16:42.084 --> 16:43.460
Killing Titans,

16:43.836 --> 16:45.129
blocking a cannonball,

16:45.504 --> 16:46.839
lifting a boulder.

16:47.631 --> 16:52.344
In each instance, you had
a clear goal prior to transforming.

16:53.554 --> 16:57.766
It's possible that self-inflicted harm
isn't the only trigger,

16:58.308 --> 17:01.353
you might need to have
a goal of some sort as well.

17:02.563 --> 17:04.440
It's true that this latest transformation

17:04.690 --> 17:07.026
is similar to when I stopped
that cannon shot.

17:07.818 --> 17:08.902
But...

17:09.611 --> 17:12.322
Transforming into a Titan
to pick up a spoon?

17:13.949 --> 17:15.743
This is crazy.

17:17.786 --> 17:22.291
In other words,
you didn't break the rules on purpose?

17:23.042 --> 17:23.917
That's right.

17:38.766 --> 17:39.600
What?

17:39.892 --> 17:40.809
What?

17:41.435 --> 17:43.562
Wait! What are you doing?

17:44.021 --> 17:45.481
That hurts!

17:46.440 --> 17:47.983
This really hurts.

17:48.484 --> 17:51.779
Eren, I'm impressed you can bite
so deep like this.

17:52.488 --> 17:54.490
We made an error in judgment.

17:55.282 --> 17:57.117
This is our small way of paying for that.

17:57.618 --> 17:59.578
So it's no big deal.

18:00.079 --> 18:00.913
What?

18:01.288 --> 18:03.791
Our job is to keep you in check.

18:04.333 --> 18:06.418
And that isn't in the wrong!

18:06.835 --> 18:08.587
So don't get cocky, kid!

18:09.046 --> 18:10.464
I'm sorry, Eren.

18:11.340 --> 18:12.966
We were so scared.

18:14.009 --> 18:15.552
You must be disappointed in our stupidity.

18:16.678 --> 18:17.554
But...

18:17.930 --> 18:18.931
Even so...

18:19.515 --> 18:23.435
We'll be relying on you,
and we'd like you to rely on us.

18:28.857 --> 18:29.817
So...

18:30.901 --> 18:31.985
Please...

18:32.611 --> 18:33.737
Trust us.

18:43.997 --> 18:44.915
Eren!

18:45.415 --> 18:47.042
Hurry! Decide already!

18:50.212 --> 18:51.380
I'll go with you!

18:58.470 --> 19:00.097
Let go!

19:06.103 --> 19:07.354
I'm sorry!

19:14.987 --> 19:16.446
The target is speeding up!

19:17.281 --> 19:18.157
Keep moving!

19:18.448 --> 19:19.658
We're going to outrun it!

19:22.953 --> 19:24.163
Outrun it?

19:24.454 --> 19:25.539
There's no way.

19:26.415 --> 19:30.252
If we keep riding with our backs to it,
we'll all get squashed flat!

19:33.672 --> 19:34.506
But...

19:35.174 --> 19:36.758
We're on the verge of death,

19:37.259 --> 19:38.886
and we're letting our comrades die,

19:39.511 --> 19:41.597
yet everyone has chosen
to keep moving forward.

19:42.681 --> 19:45.809
Captain Levi is staring straight ahead.

19:46.977 --> 19:51.106
And the others trust him completely!

19:53.233 --> 19:56.320
I need to trust them too.

19:58.447 --> 19:59.740
Just as they

20:00.824 --> 20:02.576
trusted me!

20:18.800 --> 20:20.719
Fire!

20:41.240 --> 20:44.910
Hitch your horses a little further ahead,
then switch to omnidirectional mobility.

20:45.702 --> 20:47.371
I have to leave for now.

20:48.121 --> 20:49.665
Eld is in charge of the squad.

20:51.333 --> 20:54.294
Hide Eren a good distance away
from that Titan.

20:54.503 --> 20:55.796
Look after my horse!

21:00.968 --> 21:01.927
You don't mean...

21:03.095 --> 21:06.014
They are going to take that Titan alive?

21:11.228 --> 21:15.190
What do you think of that, Eren?
We caught that Titan!

21:15.732 --> 21:19.528
This is the might of Scout Regiment!
Don't underestimate us, you idiot!

21:19.611 --> 21:21.280
Now, do you see?

21:23.282 --> 21:24.199
Yes!

21:28.745 --> 21:30.622
It looks like she's been restrained.

21:31.290 --> 21:32.708
We can't drop our guard yet.

21:33.458 --> 21:36.753
I'm just impressed you managed
to lead her to this spot.

21:38.255 --> 21:41.466
The credit goes to the rear squad
who gave their lives fighting her.

21:41.717 --> 21:43.135
They bought us time.

21:44.136 --> 21:45.887
It would have been impossible otherwise.

21:46.847 --> 21:47.848
Is that so?

21:48.390 --> 21:49.308
Yes.

21:51.184 --> 21:52.853
Thanks to them

21:53.186 --> 21:55.856
we get to see
who is inside this one's nape.

21:58.650 --> 22:01.611
Let's just hope they are not
wetting themselves inside there.

23:43.338 --> 23:45.549
Erwin Smith's top-secret plan

23:46.550 --> 23:49.469
was to capture the Female Titan.

23:50.428 --> 23:53.932
Elite members of the Scout Regiment
attempt to reveal its true identity.

23:54.015 --> 23:54.975
But...
